</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Himself He could not save,</l><l>For justice must be done;</l><l>Our sins’ full weight must fall</l><l>Upon the sinless One;</l><l>For nothing less can God accept</l><l>In payment of that fearful debt.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Himself He could not save,</l><l>For He the Surety stood</l><l>For all who now rely</l><l>Upon His precious blood;</l><l>He bore the penalty of guilt</l><l>When on the cross His blood was spilt.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Himself He could not save,</l><l>What wondrous love is this!</l><l>In love Himself He gave,</l><l>There ne’er was love like His!</l><l>Such love should melt a heart of stone,</l><l>Till praise flows forth to Him alone!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
